        <mxCell id="FZ7i4OngoAByuXtpbpbS-38" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left; margin-left: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: inherit;&quot;&gt;Cache Redis: will contain the mapping:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left; margin-left: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: inherit;&quot;&gt;For manifest:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: inherit; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- key: hash of the search criteria requested&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: inherit; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- value: manifest built&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: inherit; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- TTL: 3 min&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left; margin-left: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: inherit;&quot;&gt;For weasis package version compatibility:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: inherit;&quot;&gt;- key: package version requested (installed on the client)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: inherit; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- value: package version installed on the server&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: inherit; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- TTL: infinite (change when uploading a newer Weasis version )&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];aut